# netlist of sch_divider.sch, from schnet
part C101 capacitor value 1U swap 1,2 name divider.c
part D101 diode name divider.clamp
part R101 resistor value 10K swap 1,2 name divider.top
part R102 resistor value 4.7K swap 1,2 name divider.bottom
net +5V global class power R101.1
net 3V3 global class power D101.2
net GND global class power C101.2 R102.2
net divider.top.2 C101.1 D101.1 R101.2 R102.1
